# =========================
# EF Core / Migrations
# =========================
# IMPORTANT:
# Do NOT ignore Migrations/ by default.
# EF Core migrations should usually be committed.
#
# Ignore only temporary migration backups or generated SQL scripts if you create them locally:
*.migration.sql
migrations.sql
MigrationScripts/
GeneratedMigrations/

